    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "After fifteen days’ exposure, they are cleared with soap as above described. Rose colour or pink, is given with safflower and lemon juice. Deep red, by a boiling hot bath of Brazil wood, after aluming. Crimson. The above deep red feathers are passed through a bath of cudbear. Prune de Monsieur. The deep red is passed through an alkaline bath. Blues of every ..."@en ;
